      "comment": "The goals saved with steps the build could not fix are collected in %brokenGoals% (BuildGoal's LeaveBroken adds\neach) and named at the end. Started here, in an existing step: a step is matched to its earlier build by its\nposition, so a step inserted among the others would make every one after it build again.",
