    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "condition.if(Left=%brokenGoals.count%, Operator=\">\", Right=0) { error.throw(Message=\"the build left goals with steps it could not fix\", Key=\"StepsBroken\", Status=400, Cause=%brokenGoals%, FixSuggestion=\"fix the words and build again\") }",
      "line": {
        "number": 22
      },
      "comment": "A goal was saved with broken steps: the build ends failed, holding each such goal's refusal whole as a cause, so the\nerror page names every goal, its step and why.",
